You'll want a couple of scrolls of charging for this.  Also,
got any teleport wands? They're better than wands of death in many
circumstances. You've probably heard thirty times by now, but I didn't
know until I'd ascended a couple of times, so: Teleport wands work
on enemies on non-teleport levels. (Except the Riders. Don't teleport
the Riders.)

